  "name": "Destination Blood Bowl",
  "ruleset": "bb2025-default",
  "date": "2027-04-17",
  "description": "Destination Blood Bowl - Charleston 2027 (17-18 April 2027). Resurrection squad event: squads of 3 coaches, one team of each race per squad. Five tiers set each team's Skill Points (5/6/7/8/9), stacking and Star Player access. Skills: primary 1 Skill Point, secondary 2; Tier 3-5 teams may stack two primary skills on a player for 3 Skill Points (Tier 3: 1 stack, Tiers 4-5: 2). Star Players for Tiers 3-5 only, after 11 rostered players, at 2 Skill Points each on top of their gold (Tiers 3-4: 1 star, no Mega-Stars; Tier 5: 2 stars, 1 of them may be a Mega-Star at 4 Skill Points). Teams are built to 1,100,000 gold, up to 1,200,000 with gold from the squad's shared treasury. Rulebook inducements only; no Mercenaries, Prayers to Nuffle or Wizards.",
  "dataNote": "Transcribed from the Destination Blood Bowl - Charleston 2027 Rules Pack (Google Doc, read 2026-11-12). Each team may be built up to 1,200,000 gold: the most one team can spend from the 3,400,000 squad treasury while the other two meet the 1,100,000 minimum. The builder shows how far a team is over 1,100,000. NOT enforced by the package model, the organiser checks by hand: (1) the squad's shared treasury of 3,400,000 gold across its three teams; (2) every team's Team Value is at least 1,100,000 gold; (3) squad teams total at most 10 Squad Points (Tier 1 = 5, Tier 2 = 4, Tier 3 = 3, Tier 4 = 2, Tier 5 = 1); (4) one team of each race per squad; (5) no Star Player hired by two teams in the same squad; (6) Star Players only after 11 rostered players. Rulebook inducements only: the Spike! Journal items (Bretonnian Pastries, Bretonnian Damsel, Canopic Jar) are left out. The pack bans Mercenaries, Prayers to Nuffle and Wizards; everything else on the rulebook list is allowed, including the Weather Mage and Infamous Coaching Staff.",
